.godot/
art_export/
*.tmp
export/
*.apk
*.aab
*.pck
.godot-prompter-cache/
art_iterations/
__pycache__/

# The web build is a COMMITTED artifact, not a byproduct: GitHub Pages serves
# `docs/` straight off `main`, so the .pck and the .wasm have to be in history.
# Everything under docs/ is written by `bash tools/web_build.sh` and should
# never be hand-edited.
!docs/*.pck
